ta, different analysts : variation in effect sizes due to analytical decisions in ecology and evolutionary biology","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-796205","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Wind power accounted for 8% of global electricity generation in 2023 and is one of the cheapest forms of low- carbon electricity. Although fully commercial, many challenges remain in achieving the required scale-up, relating to integrating wind farms into wider technical, economic, social, and natural systems. We review the main challenges, outline existing solutions, and propose future research needed to overcome existing problems. Although the techno-economic challenges of grid and market integration are seen as significant obstacles to scaling up wind power, the field is replete with solutions. In many countries, planning and permitting are immediate barriers to wind-power deployment; although solutions are emerging in the EU and several countries, the effectiveness and long-term acceptance of fast-track permissions and go-to areas remains to be seen. Environmental impacts on wildlife and recycling challenges are rising issues for which tested and scalable solutions are often still lacking, pointing to large remaining research requirements.","author_count":23,"contributors":["Mckenna, Russell","Lilliestam, Johan","Heinrichs, Heidi U.","Weinand, Jann","Schmidt, Johannes","Staffell, Iain","Hahmann, Andrea N.","Burgherr, Peter","Burdack, Arne","Bucha, Monika","Chen, Ruihong","Klingler, Michael","Lehmann, Paul","Lowitzsch, Jens","Novo, Riccardo","Price, James","Sacchi, Romain","Scherhaufer, Patrick","Scholl, Eva M.","Visconti, Piero","Velasco-Herrejon, Paola","Zeyringer, Marianne","Camargo, Luis Ramirez"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-798516"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Mckenna, Russell"],"country":["Austria","Germany","Netherlands","Norway","Switzerland","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Forschungszentrum Jülich GmbH","Friedrich-Alexander University Erlangen-Nürnberg","Helmholtz Centre for Environmental Research","Imperial College London","International Institute for Applied Systems Analysis","Kelso Institute","Paul Scherrer Institute","Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Zurich","University College London","University of Natural Resources and Life Sciences, Vienna","University of Oslo","Utrecht University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"system impacts of wind energy developments key research challenges and opportunities","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.joule.2024.11.016","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-798516","identifier":[{"id":"001401303300001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85216920344","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-fed102c6-1183-4837-8e04-2a79c2904eb2"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-423D798B97CA0CF32168874EC0CB65CB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.joule.2024.11.016","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/389589994/1-s2.0-S2542435124005130-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ch","key":"swiss federal institute of technology zurich","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Swiss Federal Institute of Technology Zurich","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"friedrich alexander university erlangen nürnberg","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Friedrich-Alexander University Erlangen-Nürnberg","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"forschungszentrum jülich gmbh","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Forschungszentrum Jülich GmbH","used":1},{"affno