rticle","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-800802","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"De novo or acquired resistance to chemotherapy is ubiquitous in pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC). SCO-101 is an oral compound that may counteract chemo-resistance by interacting with SRPK1, ABCG2 drug transporter, and liver enzyme UGT1A1. We first conducted preclinical experiments in paclitaxel-resistant PDAC cells to access the tumoricidal effects of SCO-101 or SRPK1-inhibitor alone or in combination with paclitaxel. Second, we enrolled 22 patients with non-resectable PDAC in a phase Ib trial to investigate safety and pharmaco-kinetics, and to establish maximum tolerated dose (MTD) by evaluation of dose-limiting toxicities (DLTs) during the first cycle of 80% dose gemcitabine (Gem) and nab-paclitaxel (Nab) together with increasing doses of SCO-101. In paclitaxel-resistant PDAC cells in vitro, a synergistic effect between SCO-101 and paclitaxel was demonstrated. In patients, daily doses for 6 days of SCO-101 resulted in a two- to threefold drug accumulation, and drug exposure was dose proportional. Treatment was well tolerated. Transiently increased blood bilirubin attributable to SCO-101 was observed in 12 cases (55%) and associated with jaundice in three patients. One and two DLTs, respectively, were observed at 150 and 250mg dosing-levels of SCO-101, and the MTD was determined to be 200 mg of SCO-101 daily for 6 days on a bi-weekly schedule together with 80% dose of Gem and Nab. Median progression-free and overall survival was 3.3 and 9.5 months, respectively. In PDAC, SCO-101 can be added to Gem and Nab with little and manageable toxicity. However, no clear added efficacy signal was observed of the combination. Trial registration number: NCT04652205 (Nov 29, 2020).","author_count":16,"contributors":["Shim, Susy","Reinacher-Schick, Anke","Kraeft, Anna Lena","Pfeiffer, Per","Tarpgaard, Line Schmidt","Ettrich, Thomas Jens","Kestler, Angelika","Christensen, Signe","Jandu, Haatisha","Nawabi, Mubeen","Roest, Nicklas Lindland","Damstrup, Lars","Vestlev, Peter Michael","Brünner, Nils","Stenvang, Jan","Ladekarl, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-812739"],"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Ladekarl, Morten"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Ruhr University Bochum","University Hospital Ulm"],"keyword":["Gemcitabine","Nab paclitaxel","Pancreas cancer"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-NDR"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-NDR","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pantax a phase ib clinical trial of the efflux pump inhibitor sco 000000000101 in combination with gemcitabine and nab paclitaxel in non resectable or metastatic pancreatic cancer","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10637-025-01526-7","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-812739","identifier":[{"id":"40272619","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC12048447","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"105003445346","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-c5ac2795-1e23-476f-84b4-530e45513aa7"],"keyword":["Chemotherapy resistance mechanisms","Cytotoxicity assay","Gemcitabine","Nab-paclitaxel","Pancreas cancer"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-A647CB804CAC54016E3CBE216AD528B0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10637-025-01526-7","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/289350100/s10637-025-01526-7.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Aalborg University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"ruhr university bochum","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Ruhr University Bochum","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Oncology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"de","key":"university hospital ulm","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University Hospital Ulm","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Scandion Oncology A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Susy","key":"shimpau","last":"Shim","name":"Shim, Susy","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anke","key":"reinacherschickpau","last":"Reinacher-Schick","name":"Reinacher-Schick, Anke","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anna Lena","key":"kraeftpau","last":"Kraeft","name":"Kraeft, Anna Lena","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Pfeiffer","key":"perpfeifferpau","last":"Per Pfeiffer","locid":"37da1b83-d32a-4f6c-bde6-ca05372851a5","name":"Pfeiffer, Per","name_org":"Per Pfeiffer, Pfeiffer","orcid":"0000-0002-2925-0586","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Line Schmidt","key":"tarpgaardpau","last":"Tarpgaard","locid":"189434fc-a387-4c7d-86b9-5e44c8cf4e01","name":"Tarpgaard, Line Schmidt","orcid":"0000-0001-8505-2544","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Jens","key":"ettrichpau","last":"Ettrich","name":"Ettrich, Thomas Jens","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Angelika","key":"kestlerpau","last":"Kestler","name":"Kestler, Angelika","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Signe","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Signe","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Haatisha","key":"jandupau","last":"Jandu","name":"Jandu, Haatisha","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Mubeen","key":"nawabipau","last":"Nawabi","name":"Nawabi, Mubeen","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Nicklas Lindland","key":"roestpau","last":"Roest","name":"Roest, Nicklas Lindland","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"damstruppau","last":"Damstrup","name":"Damstrup, Lars","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Michael","key":"vestlevpau","last":"Vestlev","name":"Vestlev, Peter Michael","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Nils","key":"brünnerpau","last":"Brünner","name":"Brünner, Nils","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"stenvangpau","last":"Stenvang","name":"Stenvang, Jan","r