"rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38649295"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/ehf2.14780","issn":["20555822"],"issue":"4","journal":"ESC Heart Failure","pages":"2305-2313","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"ESC Heart Failure","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85191153245"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-9ec5f08b-0cef-46dd-b3ad-a784ad27067f"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Haemodynamic implications of VA-ECMO vs. VA-ECMO plus Impella CP for cardiogenic shock in a large animal model","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-755487","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The production and consumption of plastics have soared to an alarming situation globally. Plastic waste management through landfilling and incineration cause many environmental issues and land squandering. For marine plastic pollution, marine animals (seabirds, whales, fish, turtles) may mistake plastic waste for prey. Thus, they then die due to the starvation as their stomachs become filled with plastic. The traditional plastic waste treatments focus on the high-energy input, but are not ecofriendly. The emergence of nanocatalyzed chemical upcycling of plastic waste approaches, aiming to convert wastes to value-added chemicals. The ecological, economic, and societal issues demand immediate action for the constructive pathway of waste management. Therefore, a large amount of plastic waste is out there for recycling. Mechanical recycling is mainly used as recycling technology for plastic waste, which is limited due to degradation and pretreatment processes. On the other hand, from the stance of sustainability, chemical recycling is an alternative to overcome issues related to mechanical recycling. This recycling technology allows plastics to be reproduced from their waste with similar properties to pristine materials. Several precious chemicals can be produced through this technique with a variety of applications as raw materials, fuels, and a replacement of petrochemical feedstocks. This chapter mainly focuses on chemical recycling technologies for varied kind of plastic waste.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Adeel, Muhammad","Jamil, Huma","Taherzadeh, Mohammad J.","Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","Bilal, Muhammad"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-755588"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","Poland","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Gdańsk University of Technology","Polish Academy of Sciences","University of Antwerp","University of Borås"],"keyword":["Circular economy","Plastic waste","Pyrolysis","Waste management"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"chemical recycling of plastic waste for sustainable development","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85199659128","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-755588","identifier":[{"id":"85199659128","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-d8ce0568-e93c-48cf-9721-6dc361e31fe7"],"keyword":["Plastic waste","circular economy","marine plastic pollution, nanocatalyst, chemical recycling","pyrolysis","waste management"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-16C8FF47AAAE9AD5D543B8C232CD910A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"be","key":"university of antwerp","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Antwerp","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"pl","key":"polish academy of sciences","loc":["Poland","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Polish Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"university of borås","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Borås","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"pl","key":"gdańsk university of technology","loc":["Poland","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Gdańsk University of Technology","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Muhammad","key":"adeelpau","last":"Adeel","name":"Adeel, Muhammad","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Huma","key":"jamilpau","last":"Jamil","name":"Jamil, Huma","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Mohammad J.","key":"taherzadehpau","last":"Taherzadeh","name":"Taherzadeh, Mohammad J.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Ejbye","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"14ca7f5b-030e-46a8-8aef-a09f6fa018f5","name":"Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","orcid":"0000-0001-6067-5032","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Muhammad","key":"bilalpau","last":"Bilal","name":"Bilal, Muhammad","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Muhammad","key":"bilalpedh","last":"Bilal","name":"Bilal, Muhammad","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Hafiz M. N.","key":"iqbalpedh","last":"Iqbal","name":"Iqbal, Hafiz M. N.","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Tuan Anh","key":"nguyenpedh","last":"Nguyen","name":"Nguyen, Tuan Anh","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ghulam","key":"yasinpedh","last":"Yasin","name":"Yasin, Ghulam","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ram K.","key":"guptapedh","last":"Gupta","name":"Gupta, Ram K.","rank":10,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/b978-0-443-15660-1.00021-6","edition":"1.","eisbn":["9780443156601"],"isbn":["9780443156618"],"pages":"527-565","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Nanotechnology to Monitor, Remedy, and Prevent Pollution"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85199659128"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-d8ce0568-e93c-48cf-9721-6dc361e31fe7"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Chemical recycling of plastic waste for sustainable development","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-755588","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"OT-slab road bridges and their capacity were investigated in a comprehensive Danish research project. Such bridges are constructed with prefabricated prestressed overturned T-section beams with in-situ concrete cast on top and are combined with transverse reinforcement for shear load transfer. Often existing bridges suffer from low capacity evaluations insufficient to meet current and future traffic-load requirements. However, recent studies indicate higher capacities than predicted in applied theory. This capacity increase seems to be due to slab behavior rather than strip behavior where insufficient interaction between the OT-elements is presumed. This paper presents evaluations of OT-bridge slabs, based on results from a Danish bridge testing project, (V1), initiated in 2016. The study evaluates capacities in relation to the strip method and yield line theory where Danish standard classification vehicle loads are applied. The results indicate that the strip method may underestimate the capacity of the tested OT-slabs that the yield line theory may be a more suitable assessment method up to the demonstrated load magnitudes.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Christensen, Christian Overgaard","Schmidt, J. W.","Bang, R.","von Scholten, C.","Goltermann, Per","Damsgaard, K. D.S.","Engelund, S."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-764373"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danish Road Directorate"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-COWI"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-COWI","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"load testing and evaluation of inverted t section slabs in road bridges","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1201/9781003483755-39","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-764373","identifier":[{"id":"85200349350","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-b666e1a9-8adb-42c6-98f8-747880d1c8bf"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-205204C452540DEBE0F4D13287A2421B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/376177642/Load_testing_and_evaluation_of_inverted_T-section_slabs_in_road_bridges_24_10_02_14_26_28.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1201/9781003483755-39","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil and Mechanical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Danish Road Directorate"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"cowi","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-COWI","l3nl":"COWI A/S","l3nn":"COWI","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"COWI","namevar":["COWI A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-COWI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1