f Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-070e109f-890b-4745-8846-d4655c5aeb3e","ku-14aacb21-bd01-45d6-8740-8b2eedaa7d5f","sdu-1a9c22b4-345a-4ca6-80d4-ba562d27025d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Microaxial Flow Pump or Standard Care in Infarct-Related Cardiogenic Shock","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.97-735085","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"In video meetings, individuals may wish to share various physical objects with remote participants, such as physical documents, design prototypes, and personal belongings. However, our formative study discovered that this poses several challenges, including difficulties in referencing a remote user’s physical objects, the limited visibility of the object, and the friction of properly framing and orienting an object to the camera. To address these challenges, we propose ThingShare, a video-conferencing system designed to facilitate the sharing of physical objects during remote meetings. With ThingShare, users can quickly create digital copies of physical objects in the video feeds, which can then be magnified on a separate panel for focused viewing, overlaid on the user’s video feed for sharing in context, and stored in the object drawer for reviews. Our user study demonstrated that ThingShare made initiating objectcentric conversations more efficient and provided a more stable and comprehensive view of shared objects.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Hu, Erzhen","Grønbæk, Jens Emil","Ying, Wen","Du, Ruofei","Heo, Seongkook"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-184718"],"event":{"end":"2023-04-28","place":"Hamburg, de","start":"2023-04-23","title":"The ACM CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems (CHI'23)","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Virginia"],"keyword":["Collaborative work","Video mediated communication"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thingshare ad hoc digital copies of physical objects for sharing things in video meetings","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3544548.3581148","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-184718","identifier":[{"id":"85160011963","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-6101342b-fc83-47a0-8aeb-8d2ea36c4775"],"keyword":["augmented communication","collaborative work","object-centered meetings","shared task space","video-mediated communication"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C3CF78687B4AECCEDFC222AFADBF0E26"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3544548.3581148","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://erzhenh.com/pdfs/CHI2023-ThingShare.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"university of virginia","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Virginia","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erzhen","key":"hupau","last":"Hu","name":"Hu, Erzhen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Emil","key":"grønbækpau","last":"Grønbæk","locid":"cb34ed1e-a18d-4b6d-8f80-1cace0ea64c2","name":"Grønbæk, Jens Emil","orcid":"0000-0002-9566-7195","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wen","