:"Lindholm","name":"Lindholm, Matias G","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Emil","key":"moserpau","last":"Moser","name":"Moser, Emil","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Benjamin C","key":"nyholmpau","last":"Nyholm","name":"Nyholm, Benjamin C","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Laust E R","key":"oblingpau","last":"Obling","name":"Obling, Laust E R","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Laura","key":"sarkisianpau","last":"Sarkisian","locid":"472392ba-c3e3-4a00-ae8e-9a24b7706ab3","name":"Sarkisian, Laura","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Frederik T","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","name":"Søndergaard, Frederik T","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jakob H","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Jakob H","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens J","key":"thunepau","last":"Thune","name":"Thune, Jens J","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"venøpau","last":"Venø","locid":"f006f0e3-3074-4c22-97ad-860dfe95c0fa","name":"Venø, Søren","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian C","key":"wibergpau","last":"Wiberg","name":"Wiberg, Sebastian C","rank":26,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Matilde","key":"wintherjensenpau","last":"Winther-Jensen","name":"Winther-Jensen, Matilde","rank":27,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin A S","key":"meyerpau","last":"Meyer","name":"Meyer, Martin A S","rank":28,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"kjaergaardpau","last":"Kjaergaard","name":"Kjaergaard, Jesper","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36342119"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1056/nejmoa2212528","issn":["00284793","15334406"],"issn_org":["00284793"],"issue":"10","journal":"The New England Journal of Medicine","pages":"888-897","status":"p","title":"The New England Journal of Medicine","title_org":"New England Journal of Medicine","volume":"388"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85150000006"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-46cfe058-66a5-4eb1-8dc1-67e52fde286e","sdu-3e99d5f2-7e6f-4e2e-bd57-2fba45f0b9ff"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Duration of Device-Based Fever Prevention after Cardiac Arrest","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.94-686241","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"AIMS: Previous small-scale studies have indicated a short-term stroke incidence of 1.0-1.3% following Takotsubo (syndrome). In this nationwide register-based study, we investigated the 90-day risk of ischemic stroke (IS) or transient ischemia attack (TIA) and mortality of patients with Takotsubo. METHODS AND RESULTS: Patients with incident Takotsubo between January 1st 2009 to September 30th 2018 were identified from Danish nationwide registries. Takotsubo patients were age- and sex-matched with background-, atrial fibrillation/flutter- (AF) and myocardial infarction (MI) cohorts. Cumulative incidences and Cox proportional-hazard regression models were used to analyze the following outcomes: 1) composite of IS/TIA and 2) all-cause mortality. A total of 890 patients with Takotsubo were followed for 90 days. The cumulative 90-day incidence of IS/TIA in the Takotsubo-, background-, AF- and MI cohort, was 2.1% (n = 19), 0.1% (n = 4), 1.1% (n = 47) and 1.5% (n = 66), respectively. The cumulative 90-day mortality in the Takotsubo-, background-, AF- and MI cohort was 5.1% (n = 45), 0.3% (n = 13), 1.7% (n = 75) and 5.6% (n = 230), respectively. The adjusted hazard ratio (HR) for 90-day IS/TIA was when compared to the background-, AF- and MI cohort, 26.43 (95% CI: 8.82-79.24), 1.91 (95% CI: 1.09-3.35) and 2.06 (95% CI: 1.12-3.79), respectively. The adjusted HR for 90-day mortality was when compared to the background-, AF- and MI cohort, 14.19 (95% CI: 7.43-27.09), 0.73 (95% CI: 0.52-1.02) and 1.96 (95% CI: 1.25-3.07), respectively. CONCLUSION: Patients with Takotsubo had an increased 90-day hazard for IS/TIA when compared to age- and sex-matched background-, AF- and MI cohorts.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Jessen, Nicolai","Andersen, Jens Aamann","Tayal, Bhupendar","Østergaard, Lauge","Andersen, Mikkel Porsborg","Schmidt, Morten","Fosbøl, Emil Loldrup","Schou, Morten","Søgaard, Peter","Gislason, Gunnar","Torp-Pedersen, Christian","Køber, Lars","Kragholm, Kristian"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-741603"],"filters":{"added":"2023-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Jessen, Nicolai"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","General medicine department and Internal Medicine Outpatient Clinic"],"keyword":["Mortality","Stroke","Takotsubo syndrome","Transient ischemic attack"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"takotsubo syndrome and stroke risk a nationwide register based study","src":["aau","au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85169513129&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-741603","identifier":[{"id":"37619873","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85169513129","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f04940b6-dd9a-40e1-82bc-a067b30f2c8f","au-ea65d7b3-91dc-480d-87c9-7959fea9f888","ku-fbcd5569-042e-4892-842a-7aac5923473a"],"keyword":["Mortality","Stroke","Takotsubo syndrome","Transient ischemic attack"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-E89146F74F26EF11D92F978DD66EAE72"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"general medicine department and internal medicine outpatient clinic","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"General medicine department and Internal Medicine Outpatient Clinic","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneo