","name":"Schiødt, Frank Vinholt","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Andreas","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Andreas","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kirsten","key":"nørgaardpau","last":"Nørgaard","locid":"771b216e-eeb8-449e-8cde-2cdd59ae6dbc","name":"Nørgaard, Kirsten","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 5","first":"Signe","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Signe","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Elias B.","key":"rashupau","last":"Rashu","name":"Rashu, Elias B.","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lise L.","key":"gluudpau","last":"Gluud","locid":"5f316a6f-fef0-44ac-ad8d-522731684721","name":"Gluud, Lise Lotte","name_org":"Gluud, Lise L.","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Steen B.","key":"haugaardpau","last":"Haugaard","locid":"6fef997b-dc58-4cc9-ab00-4a3e92968454","name":"Haugaard, Steen Bendix","name_org":"Haugaard, Steen B.","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens J.","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"864b6401-9024-4773-9bdb-f4d4ca57dcad","name":"Holst, Jens Juul","name_org":"Holst, Jens J.","orcid":"0000-0001-6853-3805","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jørgen","key":"rungbypau","last":"Rungby","locid":"16f0bbd5-607e-422d-949d-13546554c84e","name":"Rungby, Jørgen","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Nicolai J.","key":"weweralbrechtsenpau","last":"Wewer Albrechtsen","locid":"0d59b767-fdca-42a0-b879-70fb0ec55651","name":"Wewer Albrechtsen, Nicolai J","name_org":"Wewer Albrechtsen, Nicolai J.","orcid":"0000-0003-4230-5753","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36596314"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.peptides.2022.170938","issn":["01969781","18735169"],"issn_org":["01969781"],"journal":"Peptides","paperid":"170938","publisher":"Elsevier Inc.","status":"p","title":"Peptides","volume":"161"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85145843295"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-747b7db4-ffca-402a-9e23-693d4956b3dc","ku-252e691e-fad6-44fe-9e23-6053a6a806b1"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Development of a glucagon sensitivity test in humans : Pilot data and the GLUSENTIC study protocol","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-021183","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: We aimed to investigate if diabetic retinopathy (DR), glaucoma and/or ocular hypertension (OHT) are prospectively linked, as previous studies have proposed cross-sectional associations, but longitudinal data from larger cohorts are lacking. METHODS: We performed a bidirectional 5 years prospective, registry-based cohort study. We extracted data from national registers, including the Danish Registry of Diabetic Retinopathy, the Danish Civil Registration System, the Danish National Patient Register and the Danish National Prescription Registry. DR level was defined by the highest level of the two eyes. Glaucoma and/or OHT was defined by diagnostic codes (H40*) or at least three redeemed prescriptions of glaucoma medication (S01E*) within 1 year. We included 205 970 persons with diabetes and 1 003 170 age- and gender-matched non-diabetes controls. Exposures were level-specific DR (i) and glaucoma and/or OHT (ii), and outcomes were hazard ratios (HRs) for 5 years incident glaucoma and/or OHT (i) and DR (ii). RESULTS: Persons with diabetes were more likely to develop glaucoma and/or OHT (multivariable adjusted HR 1.11, 95% CI 1.06-1.15), but this did not depend on the level of DR. In persons with diabetes, those with glaucoma and/or OHT were more likely to develop DR (multivariable adjusted HR 1.12, 95% CI 1.03-1.23) within 5 years. CONCLUSION: In a national cohort, diabetes associated with a little higher risk of upcoming glaucoma and/or OHT, and, inversely, the presence of the latter predicted a higher risk of incident DR. Nevertheless, our data do not seem to justify including glaucoma evaluation in the national Danish DR-screening programme.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Sperling, Signe","Stokholm, Lonny","Thykjær, Anne Suhr","Pedersen, Frederik Nørregaard","Möller, Sören","Laugesen, Caroline Schmidt","Andersen, Nis","Andresen, Jens","Bek, Toke","la Cour, Morten","Hajari, Javad","Heegaard, Steffen","Højlund, Kurt","Kawasaki, Ryo","Kolko, Miriam","Schielke, Katja Christina","Rubin, Katrine Hass","Vestergaard, Anders Højslet","Grauslund, Jakob"],"cuid":["S03-094.14-672292"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Sperling, Signe"],"country":["Japan"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Osaka University","The University of Osaka","University of Osaka"],"keyword":["Cohort Studies","Cross Sectional Studies","Diabetes","Diabetes mellitus","Diabetic Retinopathy diagnosis","Diabetic retinopathy","Epidemiology","Glaucoma","Glaucoma diagnosis","Humans","Ocular Hypertension diagnosis","Ocular hypertension","Prospective Studies","Risk Factors"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Dansk Medicinsk Ortoptisk Forening"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bidirectional 000000000005 year risks of diabetic retinopathy glaucoma and or ocular hypertension results from a national screening programme","src":["aau","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aos.15300","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S03-094.14-672292","identifier":[{"id":"85144128949","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36514165","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-3f82727b-34ec-4aa8-98a5-45318a09dcd1","ku-8e4f2cb1-e2cc-4e5a-a964-250f8b45f1f6","sdu-3e00e62a-660a-4fe4-ae73-a959a0688c0a"],"keyword":["Cohort Studies","Cross-Sectional Studies","Diabetes Mellitus","Diabetic Retinopathy/diagnosis","Glaucoma/diagnosis","Humans","Ocular Hypertension/diagnosis","Prospective Studies","Risk Factors","diabetes","diabetic retinopathy","epidemiology","glaucoma","ocular hypertension"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-936C23F32893D7E7DB31736247304F91"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/533084394/Sperling_et_al_2023_Bidirectional_5_year_risks_of_diabetic_retinopathy_glaucoma.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/223124200/Acta_Ophthalmologica_2022_Sperling_Bidirectional_5_year_risks_of_diabetic_retinopathy_glaucoma_and_or_ocular.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/347874785/Acta_Ophthalmologica_2022_Sperling_Bidirectional_5_year_risks_of_diabetic_retinopathy_glaucoma_and_or_ocular.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aos.15300","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Ophthalmology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities