{"abstract":"Research within biological methanation has been a great development using biotrickling filters (BTF), as a power-to-x solution, but research within up scaling is missing. This study investigates the commercial potential of biomethanation in BTF by operating two 1 m3 reactors which was implemented into a full-scale biogas plant. Several areas were investigated, such as enrichment and start-up, long-term steady state operation, serial operation, and intermittent feed. A methane productivity of 9.44 NmCH43 mR-3 day-1 with a product gas of 95.7 % CH4 was obtained for parallel operation, whereas during serial operation a methane productivity of 10.6 NmCH43 mR-3 day-1 at 97.4 % CH4 was achieved. The flexibility of the biomethanation was demonstrated with unintentional loss of H2 feed in periods of 12 to 72 h, where initial performance was regained within 6 to 12 h. The results from this study demonstrate the potential for commercial use of biomethanation in BTF for future Power-to-X solutions.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Jønson, Brian Dahl","Tsapekos, Panagiotis","Tahir Ashraf, Muhammed","Jeppesen, Martin","Ejbye Schmidt, Jens","Bastidas-Oyanedel, Juan Rodrigo"],"cuid":["S02-098.44-036925"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Ashraf, Muhammad Tahir","Tahir Ashraf, Muhammed"],"keyword":["Biofuels","Biogas","Biomethanation","Biomethane","Bioreactors","Carbon dioxide","Methane","Pilot Projects","Pilot scale","Power to X"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pilot scale study of biomethanation in biological trickle bed reactors converting impure co sub 000000000002 sub from a full scale biogas plant","src":["dtu","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2022.128160","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The author was grateful that this study was financially supported by the project “eFuel – Electrofuel from a bio-trickling filter”, which is a Energiteknologisk Udviklings- og Demonstrationsprogram (EUDP) project (Project ID 64018-0559)."],"id":"S02-098.44-036925","identifier":[{"id":"85140294996","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36273766","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-bf0ea82d-0ce0-4483-b92e-3f132e896291","sdu-d2bf146c-bd03-48a2-b221-47ec36d6b164"],"keyword":["Biofuels","Biogas","Biomethanation","Biomethane","Bioreactors","Carbon Dioxide","Methane","Pilot Projects","Pilot scale","Power-to-x"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-508CAD5CCE88375E79BD485107A1FB34"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/212003272/Pilot_scale_study_of_biomethanation_in_...pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biortech.2022.128160","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/293187037/1_s2.0_S0960852422014936_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)","SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT), SDU Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Nature Energy A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, Bio Conversions"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Brian Dahl","key":"jønsonpau","last":"Jønson","locid":"6e282225-3933-4b06-a6ed-646cb3ae91f4","name":"Jønson, Brian Dahl","orcid":"0000-0001-9051-4627","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Panagiotis","key":"tsapekospau","last":"Tsapekos","locid":"9cee20d0-eccd-40a3-a5a2-d843033c1c35","name":"Tsapekos, Panagiotis","orcid":"0000-0002-5309-4624","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Muhammed","key":"tahirashrafpau","last":"Tahir Ashraf","locid":"c15b128f-8f64-4d40-9e4f-79bdd23143a7","name":"Ashraf, Muhammad Tahir","name_org":"Tahir Ashraf, Muhammed","orcid":"0000-0003-3101-3421","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"jeppesenpau","last":"Jeppesen","name":"Jeppesen, Martin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens","key":"ejbyeschmidtpau","last":"Ejbye Schmidt","locid":"14ca7f5b-030e-46a8-8aef-a09f6fa018f5","name":"Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","name_org":"Ejbye Schmidt, Jens","orcid":"0000-0001-6067-5032","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Juan Rodrigo","key":"bastidasoyanedelpau","last":"Bastidas-Oyanedel","locid":"840da3ca-81a6-461d-a027-5716b944217e","name":"Bastidas-Oyanedel, Juan Rodrigo","orcid":"0000-0002-2418-441X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36273766"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.biortech.2022.128160","issn":["09608524","18732976"],"issn_org":["09608524"],"journal":"Bioresource Technology","paperid":"128160","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Bioresource Technology","volume":"365"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85140294996"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark","nature energy a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-bf0ea82d-0ce0-4483-b92e-3f132e896291","sdu-d2bf146c-bd03-48a2-b221-47ec36d6b164"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Pilot-scale study of biomethanation in biological trickle bed reactors converting impure CO<sub>2</sub> from a Full-scale biogas plant","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.44-036925","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"AIMS: In refractory out-of-hospital cardiac arrest (OHCA) with prolonged whole-body ischaemia, global tissue injury proceeds even after establishment of circulation with extracorporeal cardiopulmonary resuscitation (ECPR). We aimed to investigate the role of biomarkers reflecting hypoperfusion, inflammation, and organ injury in prognostication of patients with refractory OHCA managed with ECPR. METHODS AND RESULTS: This nationwide retrospective study included 226 adults with refractory OHCA managed with ECPR in Denmark (2011-2020). Biomarkers the first days after ECPR-initiation were assessed. Odds ratio of favourable neurological status (Cerebral Performance Category 1-2) at hospital discharge was estimated by logistic regression analyses. Cut-off values were calculated using the Youden's index. Fifty-six patients (25%) survived to hospital discharge, 51 (91%) with a favourable neurological status. Factors independently associated with favourable neurological status were low flow time <81 min, admission leukocytes ≥12.8 × 109/L, admission lactate <13.2 mmol/L, alkaline phosphatase (ALP) < 56 (day1) or <55 U/L (day2), and day 1 creatine kinase MB (CK-MB) < 500 ng/mL. Selected biomarkers (leukocytes, C-reactive protein, and lactate) were significantly better predictors of favourable neurological status than classic OHCA-variables (sex, age, low-flow time, witnessed arrest, shockable rhythm) alone (P = 0.001) after hospital admission. CONCLUSION: Biomarkers of hypoperfusion (lactate), inflammation (leucocytes), and organ injury (ALP and CK-MB) were independently associated with neurological status at hospital discharge. Biomarkers of hypoperfusion and inflammation (at hospital admission) and organ injury (days 1 and 2 after ECPR) may aid in the clinical decision of when to prolong or terminate ECPR in cases of refractory OHCA.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Gregers, Emilie","Mørk, Sivagowry Rasalingam","Linde, Louise","Andreasen, Jo Bønding","Smerup, Morten","Kjærgaard, Jesper","Møller-Sørensen, Peter Hasse","Holmvang, Lene","Christensen, Steffen","Terkelsen, Christian Juhl","Tang, Mariann","Møller, Jacob Eifer","Lassen, Jens Flensted","Schmidt, Henrik","Riber, Lars Peter","Winther-Jensen, Matilde","Thomassen, Sisse Anette","Laugesen, Helle","Hassager, Christian","Søholm, Helle"],"cuid":["S04-097.65-665735"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corresponding_author":["Gregers, Emilie"],"keyword":["Adult","Biomarkers","Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation methods","Consensus statement","Coronary intervention","Elevation","Extracorporeal cardiopulmonary resuscitation","HOSPITAL CARDIAC ARREST","Humans","Hypoperfusion","Inflammation","Lactates","Neurological outcome","Organ injury","Out of Hospital Cardiac Arrest therapy","Out of hospital cardiac arrest","Retrospective Studies","SCORE"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-HJER"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-NP-HJER","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"extracorporeal cardiopulmonary resuscitation a national study on the association between favourable neurological status and biomarkers of hypoperfusion inflammation and organ injury","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85162232273","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-097.65-665735","identifier":[{"id":"36229928","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000879846200001","type":"wos"