{"abstract":"Objective To evaluate the safety and efficacy of percutaneous left atrial appendage occlusion (LAAO) using conscious sedation (CS). Background Several percutaneous structural heart disease interventions are safely and efficiently performed using CS instead of general anaesthesia (GA). This concept has not been evaluated in a large multicenter cohort of patients undergoing LAAO. Methods Patients from the prospective, global Amplatzer Amulet Occluder Observational Study were divided into two groups (GA vs CS). Baseline information, periprocedural and postprocedural efficacy and complications, as well as outcomes through 7 days post implant were compared. Results Patients undergoing transesophageal-guided implants were categorised by GA (n=607, 64%) or CS (n=342, 36%) usage. Mean age was 75 years in both groups. LAAO technical success was achieved in 99% of both groups. The procedure duration (GA: 35±22 min vs CS: 27±19 min, p<0.001), total amount of contrast medium (GA: 105±81 mL vs CS: 86±66 mL, p<0.001) and fluoroscopic time (GA: 13±9 min vs CS: 12±13 min, p<0.001) were less in CS cases. Procedure-related or device-related serious adverse events during the first 7 days were numerically higher in the CS group (GA: 4.9% vs CS: 7.6%, p=0.114). Peridevice residual flow was absent or ≤5 mm 1-3 months after the procedure in 99.7% of the GA and in 100% of the CS group (p=1.000). Conclusions In a large global study, LAAO with the Amplatzer Amulet occluder is safe and feasible using CS. Procedure duration and total amount of contrast were less with CS than GA cases. Trial registration number NCT02447081; Results.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Piayda, Kerstin","Hellhammer, Katharina","Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik","Schmidt, Boris","Mazzone, Patrizio","Berti, Sergio","Fischer, Sven","Lund, Juha","Montorfano, Matteo","Della Bella, Paolo","Gage, Ryan","Zeus, Tobias"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-201599"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Zeus, Tobias"],"country":["Finland","Germany","Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Cardioangiologisches Centrum am Bethanien Krankenhaus, Frankfurt, Germany.","Gabriele Monasterio Foundation","Harzklinikum Dorothea Christiane Erxleben GmbH","Heinrich Heine University Düsseldorf","University of Turku","Vita-Salute San Raffaele University"],"keyword":["Cardiology","Stroke medicine","Thromboembolism"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"clinical outcomes of patients undergoing percutaneous left atrial appendage occlusion in general anaesthesia or conscious sedation data from the prospective global amplatzer amulet occluder observational study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85103255153","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-201599","identifier":[{"id":"85103255153","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC7993182","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"33762228","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-7e4df990-36d9-4373-8d20-44ff1a3dffa1"],"keyword":["cardiology","stroke medicine","thromboembolism"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4E7ADC5226F2A0AB8AE347C58A41AFB7"],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"heinrich heine university düsseldorf","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Heinrich Heine University Düsseldorf","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Cardiological Medicine B"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"cardioangiologisches centrum am bethanien krankenhaus frankfurt germany","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Cardioangiologisches Centrum am Bethanien Krankenhaus, Frankfurt, Germany.","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"it","key":"gabriele monasterio foundation","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Gabriele Monasterio Foundation","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"de","key":"harzklinikum dorothea christiane erxleben gmbh","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Harzklinikum Dorothea Christiane Erxleben GmbH","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"fi","key":"university of turku","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Turku","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"it","key":"vita salute san raffaele university","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Vita-Salute San Raffaele University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kerstin","key":"piaydapau","last":"Piayda","name":"Piayda, Kerstin","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Katharina","key":"hellhammerpau","last":"Hellhammer","name":"Hellhammer, Katharina","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Erik","key":"nielsenkudskpau","last":"Nielsen-Kudsk","locid":"8629b763-e23e-41d9-ac4f-61579d19565e","name":"Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Boris","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","nam