Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Cardiology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Anæstesi, Børn, Kredsløb og Kvinder"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hanne Skou","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"ce109b51-ee32-47b8-b5be-cf8d85b971fa","name":"Jørgensen, Hanne Skou","orcid":"0000-0002-0881-2615","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Ivar Anders","key":"eidepau","last":"Eide","name":"Eide, Ivar Anders","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Trond","key":"jenssenpau","last":"Jenssen","name":"Jenssen, Trond","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"åsbergpau","last":"Åsberg","name":"Åsberg, Anders","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"bollerslevpau","last":"Bollerslev","name":"Bollerslev, Jens","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristin","key":"godangpau","last":"Godang","name":"Godang, Kristin","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"hartmannpau","last":"Hartmann","name":"Hartmann, Anders","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik Berg","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"3eff6ccc-90b4-48ee-b121-8df4865f0342","name":"Schmidt, Erik Berg","orcid":"0000-0002-0623-5666","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"My","key":"svenssonpau","last":"Svensson","name":"Svensson, My","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34371870"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/nu13072361","issn":["20726643"],"issue":"7","journal":"Nutrients","paperid":"2361","publisher":"MDPI AG","publisher_org":"M D P I AG","status":"p","title":"Nutrients","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85109305006"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-a1c106d5-11e3-4b60-8bb7-874716456cd3","au-54cdccd5-0316-4128-999f-e4fd56f1c0b5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Marine n-3 Polyunsaturated Fatty Acids and Bone Mineral Density in Kidney Transplant Recipients : A Randomized, Placebo-Controlled Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.85-007818","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Background: Reduction mammoplasty effectively improves quality of life for women with macromastia. However, little is known whether surgical- or patient-related factors affect satisfaction. Objective: The authors sought to investigate factors associated with altered patient satisfaction following reduction mammoplasty. Methods: A cross-section study was performed by sending the BREAST-Q Reduction module to all patients who had undergone reduction mammoplasty between January 2009 and December 2018 at 2 tertiary Danish hospitals. Demographics and pre-, peri-, and postoperative details were gathered from electronic medical records. Results: A total of 393 patients returned the questionnaire and were eligible for the study. Increasing age at the time of surgery was associated with higher satisfaction with breasts nipples, headache, psychosocial well-being, and outcome. Increased body mass index at the time of surgery negatively affected satisfaction with breasts and psychosocial well-being. Increase in body mass index after surgery was further associated with lower satisfaction with breasts, nipples, sexual well-being, and more pain in the breast area. Postoperative scar revision and wound infection was more common following inferior pedicle technique than superomedial technique and negatively affected satisfaction with outcome and pain in the breast area. Conclusions: Patients should be motivated to optimize their weight prior to reduction mammoplasty to achieve optimal satisfaction. Age was associated with improved patient satisfaction, which should considered when operating on younger patients. Postoperative complications affect patient satisfaction, and the superomedial technique seems to be a better choice than the inferior pedicle technique in medium-large breasts.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Mads Gustaf","Albertsdottir, Elin","Dalaei, Farima","Hesselfeldt-Nielsen, Jørgen","Schmidt, Volker J","Sørensen, Jens Ahm","Toyserkani, Navid Mohamadpour"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-046973"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Jørgensen, Mads Gustaf"],"keyword":["Body Mass Index","Breast surgery","Female","Humans","Mammaplasty adverse effects","Patient Satisfaction","Quality of Life","Retrospective Studies","Treatment Outcome"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"age and body mass index affect patient satisfaction following reduction mammoplasty a multicenter study using breast q","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85107081662","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-046973","identifier":[{"id":"33561191","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85107081662","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-e656e87e-ef79-40f0-8d65-fabcf7e0d6b7","sdu-084a2419-b6dc-489e-b85b-4b3278409939"],"keyword":["Body Mass Index","Breast/surgery","Female","Humans","Hypertrophy/surgery","Mammaplasty/adverse effects","Patient Satisfaction","Quality of Life","Retrospective Studies","Treatment Outcome"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8C8B78CADB2D2E6343E7032903373A3D"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of He