{"abstract":"Et fyldigt efterskrift til den danske oversættelse af Nietzsches 5 foredrag om de tyske dannelsesanstalters krise i 1872, der kontekstualiserer og aktualiserer disse.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Kristensen, Jens Erik","Schmidt, Lars-Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-221310"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efterskrift","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dbp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-221310","ids":["au-a163af57-c26e-405d-9109-0aac478aecb3"],"keyword":["Dannelse, ånd, uddannelse, tendens"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6B5B170A9DC2109FFD171D5F4C6FA2DE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Education Studies, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Erik","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"3ec51b47-d8ed-4387-b29d-c5a79d68b5be","name":"Kristensen, Jens Erik","orcid":"0000-0001-6484-4892","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars-Henrik","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"ec3f4765-9783-448f-8250-def8a466ffd0","name":"Schmidt, Lars-Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"edition":"2","isbn":["9788772043777"],"pages":"97-132","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"Klim","status":"p","title":"Om vore dannelsesanstalters fremtid"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-a163af57-c26e-405d-9109-0aac478aecb3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Efterskrift","type":"Book Preface, Encycl. Entry","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-221310","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"AIMS: To evaluate the safety and efficacy of left atrial appendage occlusion (LAAO) with the Amplatzer™ Amulet™ occluder. METHODS AND RESULTS: Patients with atrial fibrillation eligible for LAAO were recruited to a prospective global study. Implant procedures were undertaken with echocardiographic guidance. Transoesophageal echocardiography (TOE) was undertaken 1-3 months post-LAAO. Implant and follow-up TOEs were evaluated by a CoreLab. The primary endpoint was a composite of ischaemic stroke and cardiovascular death at 2 years. Serious adverse events were adjudicated by an independent clinical events committee. A total of 1088 patients were enrolled, aged 75.2 ± 8.5 years; 64.5% were male. CHA2DS2-VASc and HAS-BLED scores were 4.2 ± 1.6 and 3.3 ± 1.1, respectively. A total of 71.7% had prior major bleeding, and 82.8% had contraindications to oral anticoagulants. Implant success was 99.1%. Major adverse events (≤7 days post-procedure) occurred in 4.0%, including death (0.3%), stroke (0.4%), major vascular (1.3%), and device embolization (0.2%). A total of 80.2% of patients were discharged on antiplatelet therapy alone. Peridevice flow was <3 mm in 98.4% at follow-up TOE. Device-related thrombus (DRT) was seen in 1.6% of cases. Cardiovascular death or ischaemic stroke occurred in 8.7% of patients at 2 years. The ischaemic stroke rate was 2.2%/year-a 67% reduction compared to the CHA2DS2-VASc predicted rate. Major bleeding (Bleeding Academic Research Consortium type ≥ 3) occurred at rates of 10.1%/year (year 1) and 4.0%/year (year 2). CONCLUSION: Following LAAO with the Amplatzer Amulet device, the ischaemic stroke rate was reduced by 67% compared to the predicted risk. Closure was complete in 98.4% of cases and DRT seen in only 1.6%.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Hildick-Smith, David","Landmesser, Ulf","Camm, A John","Diener, Hans-Christoph","Paul, Vince","Schmidt, Boris","Settergren, Magnus","Teiger, Emmanuel","Nielsen-Kudsk, Jens Erik","Tondo, Claudio"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-249437"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","Germany","Italy","Sweden","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Cardioangiologisches Centrum Bethanien","Charité-Universitätsmedizin Berlin","Department of Hematology, University Hospital Essen, Essen, Germany","Fiona Stanley Fremantle Hospitals Group","Karolinska University Hospital","St. George's University of London","University of Milan"],"keyword":["Antithrombotic treatment","Bleeding","Bleeding risk","Closure","Death","Fibrillation","LAA closure","Prevention","Stroke","Warfarin"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"left atrial appendage occlusion with the amplatzer amulet device full results of the prospective global observational study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7421773/pdf/ehaa169.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-249437","identifier":[{"id":"PMC7421773","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85089434949","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32243499","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000581007300017","type":"wos"}],"ids":["au-d239fb14-fa56-4721-8671-9965ef6b8308"],"keyword":["Antithrombotic treatment","BLEEDING RISK","Bleeding","CLOSURE","Death","FIBRILLATION","LAA closure","PREVENTION","Stroke","WARFARIN"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E9B3A439B1BD28F20B6D9F84EA2A85B6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7421773/pdf/ehaa169.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":