rtility and risk of death : a nationwide record-linkage study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-532648","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Biomass availability in arid regions is challenging due to limited arable land and lack of freshwater. In this study, we focus on pyrolysis of two biomasses that are typically abundant agricultural biomasses in arid regions, focusing on understanding the reaction rates and Arrhenius kinetic parameters that describe the pyrolysis reactions of halophyte Salicornia bigelovii and date palm (Phoenix dactylifera) and co-pyrolysis biomass using thermogravimetric analysis under non-isothermal conditions. The mass loss data obtained from thermogravimetric analysis of S. bigelovii and date palm revealed the reaction rate peaked between 592 and 612 K for P. dactylifera leaves and 588 and 609 K for S. bigelovii at heating rates, 5, 10, and 15 K/min during the active pyrolysis phase. The activation energies for S. bigelovii and P. dactylifera leaves during this active pyrolysis phase were estimated using the Kissinger method as 147.6 and 164.7 kJ/mol, respectively, with pre-exponential factors of 3.13 × 10 9/min and 9.55 × 10 10/min for the respective biomasses. Other isoconversional models such as the Flynn-Wall-Ozawa were used to determine these kinetic parameters during other phases of the pyrolysis reaction and gave similar results.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Dzidzienyo, Prosper","Bastidas Oyanedel, Juan-Rodrigo","Schmidt, Jens Ejbye"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-601166"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East"],"corresponding_author":["Schmidt, Jens Ejbye"],"country":["United Arab Emirates"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Khalifa University"],"keyword":["Biorefinery","Halophytes","Phoenix dactylifera","Salicornia bigelovii","Thermogravimetric analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pyrolysis kinetics of arid land biomasses","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85134989738","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-601166","identifier":[{"id":"85134989738","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-61b7defc-14f8-49b6-94e3-1cb540da9f98"],"keyword":["Biorefinery","Halophytes","Phoenix dactylifera","Salicornia bigelovii","Thermogravimetric analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-744E3AB890AC8ED117FC9DF70FACC789"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ae","key":"khalifa university","loc":["United Arab Emirates","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"Khalifa University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Prosper","key":"dzidzienyopau","last":"Dzidzienyo","name":"Dzidzienyo, Prosper","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Juan-Rodrigo","key":"bastidasoyanedelpau","last":"Bastidas Oyanedel","name":"Bastidas Oyanedel, Juan-Rodrigo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Ejbye","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"14ca7f5b-030e-46a8-8aef-a09f6fa018f5","name":"Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","orcid":"0000-0001-6067-5032","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Juan-Rodrigo","key":"bastidasoyanedelpedh","last":"Bastidas-Oyanedel","name":"Bastidas-Oyanedel, Juan-Rodrigo","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens Ejbye","key":"schmidtpedh","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-10961-5_32","eisbn":["9783030109615"],"isbn":["9783030109608"],"pages":"715-725","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","subtitle":"Integrated Sustainable Processes for Biomass Conversion to Biomaterials, Biofuels, and Fertilizers","title":"Biorefinery"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85134989738"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-61b7defc-14f8-49b6-94e3-1cb540da9f98"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Pyrolysis Kinetics of Arid-Land Biomasses","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-601166","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Triolo, Jin Mi","Ashraf, Muhammad Tahir","Sieborg, Mads Ujarak","Jønson, Brian Dahl","Yde, Lars","Schmidt, Jens Ejbye"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-614258"],"event":{"end":"2019-12-13","place":"Busan, kr","start":"2019-12-10","title":"International Environmental Engineering Conference &amp; 4th International Conference on Biological Waste as Resource 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thermophilic biomethanation in a trickle bed reactor using cattle manure as nutrient media","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-614258","ids":["sdu-8f4886d4-542e-4179-8cdf-0677c911a081"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B29F50A82E235390D3CCA2883A7D60EE"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)","SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT), SDU Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jin Mi","key":"triolopau","last":"Triolo","locid":"8fc17dd7-e287-4407-9159-92394bf13a61","name":"Triolo, Jin Mi","orcid":"0000-0002-1960-9823","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Muhammad Tahir","key":"ashrafpau","last":"Ashraf","locid":"c15b128f-8f64-4d40-9e4f-79bdd23143a7","name":"Ashraf, Muhammad Tahir","orcid":"0000-0003-3101-3421","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Ujarak","key":"sieborgpau","last":"Sieborg","locid":"005f28b3-1440-4851-a57d-8db5bea44f13","name":"Sieborg, Mads Ujarak","orcid":"0000-0001-7938-2029","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Brian Dahl","key":"jønsonpau","last":"Jønson","locid":"6e282225-3933-4b06-a6ed-646cb3ae91f4","name":"Jønson, Brian Dahl","orcid":"0000-0001-9051-4627","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"ydepau","last":"Yde","locid":"e8a12adf-3b27-4597-8f37-3f9dd27743bd","name":"Yde, Lars","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Ejbye","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"14ca7f5b-030e-46a8-8aef-a09f6fa018f5","name":"Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","orcid":"0000-0001-6067-5032","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-8f4886d4-542e-4179-8cdf-0677c911a081"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Thermophilic BioMethanation in a Trickle Bed Reactor using Cattle Manure as Nutrient Media","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-614258","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Artiklen diskuterer, hvorledes den internationale forsknings- og undervisningsdisciplin, narrativ medicin, arbejder med at bruge nærlæsning af skønlitterære tekster som metode til at fremme lægestuderendes sproglige og kommunikative kompetencer. Artiklen gennemgår principperne for nærlæsning i den version, som den amerikanske narrativ medicin-forsker, Rita Charon, har udarbejdet. Artiklen diskuterer begrebet ”empatisk læsning” som en udvikling af Charons nærlæsningsprincipper og et svar på den kritiske holdning, nogle af de danske medicinstuderende har til begrebet ’”nærlæsning”, herunder gennemgås digte af Mikael Josephsen, Klaus Rifbjerg og Klaus Lynggaard. Der vises endvidere eksempler på studerendes skriveøvelser. Empatisk læsning drejer sig ikke om at studere, hvordan teksten udtrykker og fremkalder empati, eller om den har mulighed for at gøre os til bedre mennesker. Empatisk læsning er en analyserende måde at omgås tekster på, der styrker læsernes kognitive, narrative og empatiske kompetencer. Empatisk læsning drejer sig om at blive god til at opfatte de forskellige oplevelser, tekster fremkalder og repræsenterer, opfatte og forstå teksters forskellige billeder, historier, tider, steder og synsvinkler og kunne dele denne forståelse med andre.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Mai, Anne-Marie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-620383"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Narrativ medicin"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"empatisk læsning om brug af digtning i narrativ medicin","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-620383","ids":["sdu-a4cda78b-b4aa-4681-aa2e-e9b88c8d5d72"],"keyword":["Narrativ medicin"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D5F054863BF2740FB59255DF94272D6A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department for the Study of Culture","SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Culture and Language, Literature","SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Culture and Language, Uses of Literature","SDU, Faculty of Science, Danish Institute for Advanced Study","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Public Health, Danish Aging Research Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne-Marie","key":"maipau","last":"Mai","locid":"1e8e5a77-fe91-4704-9b4a-60a3a453f6b5","name":"Mai, Anne-Marie","orcid":"0000-0002-2859-634X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens Lohfert","key":"jørgensenpedh","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Jens Lohfert","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Louise","key":"mønsterpedh","last":"Mønster","name":"Mønster, Louise","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael Kallesøe","key":"schmidtpedh","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Michael Kallesøe","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788793358706"],"place":"København","publisher":"Forlaget Spring","status":"p","title":"En ny kritik"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-a4cda78b-b4aa-4681-aa2e-e9b88c8d5d72"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Empatisk læsning : Om brug af digtning i narrativ medicin","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-620383","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"The outcome of strategic decisions (such as market entry or technology adoption) depends on the structure of the situation and the decisions made by others (such as competitors, customers, or suppliers). Therefore, to anticipate and influence others’ decisions, managers must understand the strategic features of the situation and form beliefs about of others and consider that, in turn, also others may form such higher order beliefs. We introduce a two-part heuristic model of interactive decision-making drawing on insights from behavioral game theory, with the aim to guide and support managerial and strategy decisions involving multiple actors. In the first part, the decision maker designs and analyzes the situation under consideration. As a toolbox for such formulations, we provide a classification of interactive decision settings (games) drawing from the theoretical framework of aggregative games, like the Keynesian Beauty contest game, and their most simplified instances in discrete choice strategies, i.e., two-person two-strategy (2x2) games. Altogether, these games represent important interactive decision settings relevant for the business strategy field. We show how higher-order reasoning differently matters in these games. In the second part, we construct a two-step behavioral model of anchoring and adjustment, informed by the level-k model of strategic reasoning, a belief-based model about other players’ beliefs and actions. We discuss the implications of our analysis for the field of business strategy and suggest a feasible roadmap from simple to complex scenarios.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Marchiori, Davide","Nagel, Rosemarie","Schmidt, Jens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-634560"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland","Spain"],"glorg":["Aalto University","All Global Affiliations","Pompeu Fabra University"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"heuristics thinking about others and strategic management insights from behavioral game theory","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-634560","ids":["sdu-d622bd84-6cb5-44f8-9d3c-56a11b68d5ab"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6C51381F5A317263FA26798EF638247F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Department of Business & Management (DBM)","SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Department of Business & Management (DBM), Strategic Organization Design (SOD)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"es","key":"pompeu fabra university","loc":["Spain","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Pompeu Fabra University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fi","key":"aalto university","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Aalto University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Davide","key":"marchioripau","last":"Marchiori","locid":"9cafaf9b-eeee-4dd2-ac97-2b7e3c299e76","name":"Marchiori, Davide","orcid":"0000-0001-7914-5568","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rosemarie","key":"nagelpau","last":"Nagel","name":"Nagel, Rosemarie","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Jens","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-d622bd84-6cb5-44f8-9d3c-56a11b68d5ab"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Heuristics, thinking about others, and strategic management : Insights from behavioral game theory","type":"Working Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-634560","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Shifting from a fossil fuel-dependent economy to modern, sustainable development requires not only the introduction of biofuels but should also include novel and sustainable materials from renewable feedstocks. In this study, the viability of producing polyurethane-inspired elastomers manufactured through copolymerization of modified proteins from microalgae with the synthetic monomer poly(ethylene glycol) methyl ether methacrylate (PEGMA) is investigated. Techno-economic evaluation of the process reveals great potential for the technology to be economically feasible, resulting in an investment payback rate of 8.4 years under the given conditions. Sensitivity analysis shows that the process feasibility is highly dependent on the protein availability, price of copolymer, and protein concentration. Conversely, the relatively minor influence that the price of residual proteins plays in the process economics is very beneficial from the perspective of justifying algal biofuel production. A positive economic balance for the technology is achieved for a variety of different product formulations, prices, and processing techniques.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Bochenski, Tomasz","Chan, Wui Yarn","Olsen, Bradley D.","Schmidt, Jens Ejbye"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-635755"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Schmidt, Jens Ejbye"],"country":["United Arab Emirates","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Khalifa University","Massachusetts Institute of Technology"],"keyword":["Biomaterials","Biorefinery","Microalgae","Proteins"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"techno economic analysis for the production of novel bio derived elastomers with modified algal proteins as a reinforcing agent","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85134905406","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was funded by the Cooperative Agreement between the Masdar Institute of Science and Technology (Masdar Institute), Abu Dhabi, UAE and the Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT), Cambridge, MA, USA – Reference BIOREFINERY 02/MI/MI/CP/11/07633/GEN/G/00 for work under the Second Five Year Agreement."],"id":"S01-000.00-635755","identifier":[{"id":"85134905406","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-da69c23c-186a-49aa-af08-923c74e7112b"],"keyword":["Biomaterials","Biorefinery","Microalgae","Proteins"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CF80CA01ACBF4F4738FC53903DDC63A7"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ae","key":"khalifa university","loc":["United Arab Emirates","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"Khalifa University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"massachusetts institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Massachusetts Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Green Technology (IGT)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tomasz","key":"bochenskipau","last":"Bochenski","name":"Bochenski, Tomasz","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Wui Yarn","key":"chanpau","last":"Chan","name":"Chan, Wui Yarn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bradley D.