{"abstract":"Insekter og andre bestøvere er under pres, og vi står over for en krise, hvor mangel på bestøvning påvirker både biodiversitet og fødevaresikkerhed negativt.","author_count":22,"contributors":["Dupont, Yoko Luise","Bang Madsen, Henning","Rasmussen, Claus","Hansted, Lise","Kryger, Per","Ravn, Hans Peter","Schmidt, Inger Kappel","Olesen, Jens M.","Holm, Eigil","Langer, Vibeke","Sigsgaard, Lene","Eilenberg, Jørgen","Skov, Charlotte","Lassen, Kristin Marie","Ahrenfeldt, Erica Juel","Calabuig, Isabel","Holst, Niels","Boelt, Birte","Jensen, Annette Bruun","Lecocq, Antoine","Howe, Andy G.","Termansen, Mette"],"cuid":["S02-099.10-015914"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of California at San Diego"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vi må redde bierne mens tid er","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-099.10-015914","ids":["au-2d4abf6a-c846-455c-8ffa-9e36e532b877","ku-e1cf92f2-b1e1-4039-8789-41b04eb4db36"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-07C9B07922C64B8EA00541D51E813B27"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Terrestrial Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":