","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark","VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research"],"title":"Impact of red and processed meat and fibre intake on treatment outcomes among patients with chronic inflammatory diseases: protocol for a prospective cohort study of prognostic factors and personalised medicine.","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S05-095.87-011719","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Bacterial contamination is one of the major challenges faced by yeast fermentation industries as the contaminating microorganisms produce lactic acid and acetic acid, which reduces the viability of yeast, and hence fermentation yields. The primary bacterial contaminants of yeast fermentations are lactic acid bacteria (LAB). This study aims to identify potential natural antibacterial fractions from raw and pretreated lignocellulosic biomasses found in Abu Dhabi, UAE, in terms of LAB inhibition capacity, allowing growth of the yeast. The analysis was carried out using plating technique. Pretreatment liquid of the mangrove stem Avicennia marina hydrothermally pretreated at 210 °C exhibited the widest inhibition zone with an average diameter of 14.5 mm, followed by the pretreatment liquid of mangrove leaf pretreated at 190 °C, Salicornia bigelovii pretreated at 202 °C and rachis of date palm Phoenix dactylifera pretreated at 200 °C. The compounds responsible for the antibacterial activity will be characterized in further study.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Haris, Sabeera","Fang, Chuanji","Bastidas-Oyanedel, Juan Rodrigo","Prather, Kristala Jones","Schmidt, Jens Ejbye","Thomsen, Mette Hedegaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-100910"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, Middle East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Bastidas-Oyanedel, Juan Rodrigo"],"country":["United Arab Emirates","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Khalifa University of Science and Technology","Massachusetts Institute of Technology","United Arab Emirates University"],"keyword":["Bacterial contamination","Lactic acid bacteria","Lignocellulosic biomass","Yeast fermentation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"natural antibacterial agents from arid region pretreated lignocellulosic biomasses and extracts for the control of lactic acid bacteria in yeast fermentation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s13568-018-0654-8","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported by Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) and Masdar Institute of Science and Technology (MI) Flagship Project, 13KAMA1 (Biorefinery: Integrated Sustainable Processes for Biomass Conversion to Bio‑ materials, Biofuels, and Fertilizer), reference 02/MI/MI/CP/11/07633/GEN/G/00."],"id":"S01-000.00-100910","identifier":[{"id":"85051237720","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-af404a1b-2d74-4427-8c27-b401f7d18b7f"],"keyword":["Bacterial contamination","Lactic acid bacteria","Lignocellulosic biomass","Natural antibacterial","Yeast fermentation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4D9EAFB6B2599F5A43984779337E597D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/296023807/s13568_018_0654_8.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/s13568-018-0654-8","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ae","key":"khalifa university of science and technology","loc":["United Arab Emirates","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"Khalifa University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"ae","key":"united arab emirates university","loc":["United Arab Emirates","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"United Arab Emirates University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"massachusetts institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"nam