{"abstract":"The goal of TeSeR (Technology for Self-Removal) is to take the first step towards the development of a scalable, flexible, cost-efficient, but highly reliable Post-Mission-Disposal (PMD) module. This module is to be attached to the spacecraft (S/C) on ground and it shall ensure the PMD of the S/C at the end of the nominal operational lifetime or act as a removal back-up in case that the S/C cannot be controlled anymore.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Voigt, p.","Vogt, C.","Schubert, R.","Stokes, H.","Underwood, C.","Knoll, A.","Ryden, K.","Macdonald, M.","Kerr, E.","Smith, L. J.","Förstner, R.","Wander, A.","Konstantinidis, K.","Antonetti, S.","Lips, T.","Bisgaard, M.","Kristensen, Anders Schmidt","Nielsen, Jens Frederik Dalsgaard","McInnes, C."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-063520"],"event":{"end":"2017-04-21","place":"Darmstadt, de","start":"2017-04-18","title":"The 7th European Conference on Space Debris","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Post Mission Disposal","Technology for Self Removal"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"teser technology for self removal first results of an h000000002020 project to develop a post mission disposal module","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://conference.sdo.esoc.esa.int/proceedings/sdc7/paper/17/SDC7-paper17.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-063520","ids":["aau-2e787f23-7694-494f-afeb-aac296756ad1"],"keyword":["Post-Mission-Disposal","Technology for Self-Removal"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-558AA6E7110C558E88B3BE4FD505B4EA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https