{"abstract":"Currently, no consensus exists on a model describing endogenous glucose production (EGP) as a function of glucagon concentrations. Reliable simulations to determine the glucagon dose preventing or treating hypoglycemia or to tune a dual-hormone artificial pancreas control algorithm need a validated glucoregulatory model including the effect of glucagon.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Wendt, Sabrina Lyngbye","Ranjan, Ajenthen","Møller, Jan Kloppenborg","Schmidt, Signe","Boye Knudsen, Carsten","Holst, Jens Juul","Madsbad, Sten","Madsen, Henrik","Nørgaard, Kirsten","Jørgensen, John Bagterp"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-319627"],"event":{"end":"2017-02-18","place":"Paris, fr","start":"2017-02-15","title":"Advanced Technology and Treatments for Diabetes 2017","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-PR-ZEA","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"validation of a simulation model describing the glucose insulin glucagon pharmacodynamics in patients with type 000000000001 diabetes","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130315323/ATTD2017_SLW_final.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-319627","ids":["dtu-32a8110a-aeac-4ba5-974e-47325de683bf"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A74805826D7B1A3DF6256DE251174563"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130315323/ATTD2017_SLW_final.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denm