rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"129","first":"Lucinda","key":"woodwardlucindapau","last":"Woodward","name":"Woodward, Lucinda","rank":190,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"130","first":"Hai","key":"yehaipau","last":"Ye","name":"Ye, Hai","rank":191,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"131","first":"Gahyun","key":"youngahyunpau","last":"Youn","name":"Youn, Gahyun","rank":192,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"106","first":"Agata","key":"zupančičagatapau","last":"Zupančič","name":"Zupančič, Agata","rank":193,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.31820/pt.26.1.5","issn":["13320742"],"issue":"1","journal":"Psihologijske Teme","pages":"89-137","status":"p","title":"Psihologijske Teme","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85019148564"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-f7aa91d8-d520-4387-9f80-c2670c6e80dd"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Narcisismo y búsqueda estratégica del emparejamiento a corto plazo a través de las culturas : Enlaces omnipresentes a través de 11 regiones mundiales del Proyecto de la descripción de la sexualidad internacional 2","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-749526","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"AIMS: To examine the incidence of venous thromboembolism (VTE) and its risk factors among patients with implantable cardioverter-defibrillators (ICDs). METHODS AND RESULTS: All first-time ICD recipients in Denmark during 2000-12 were identified from medical databases. Incident VTEs were ascertained, overall and according to gender, age, Charlson Comorbidity Index score (no, moderate, or severe comorbidity), prior pacemaker or cardiac resynchronization therapy (CRT-D) implantation, and ICD type (single-chamber, dual-chamber, or CRT-D). We computed the risk of VTE within 3 months and 5 years of implantation, taking death into account as a competing risk. We used Cox proportional hazards regression to compute hazard ratios as estimates of incidence rate ratios (IRRs). Among 8132 ICD recipients, 136 VTEs were diagnosed during up to 13 years of follow-up (median = 3.0 years). The VTE incidence rate was thus 4.5 per 1000 person-years [95% confidence interval (CI): 3.7-5.2]. Venous thromboembolism risk was 0.3% (95% CIs ranging from 0.1 to 0.7%) within 3 months following ICD implantation regardless of comorbidity level. Within 5 years following implantation it was 1.4% (95% CI: 0.8-2.3%), 1.3% (1.0-1.8%), and 3.2% (95% CI: 2.4-4.1%) for patients with no, moderate, and severe comorbidity, respectively. Overall, severe comorbidity conferred a 2.7-fold higher incidence rate ratio than no comorbidity (95% CI: 1.6-4.6). Incidence rate ratios did not differ by gender, age, or ICD type. CONCLUSION: Three-month risk of VTE following ICD implantation was 0.3% regardless of comorbidity level. Five-year risk of VTE following ICD implantation was 1.9% and more than twice as high for patients with severe comorbidity as for patients without comorbidity.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Pedersen, Susanne Bendesgaard","Hjortshøj, Søren Pihlkjær","Bøtker, Hans Erik","Farkas, Dóra Körmendiné","Schmidt, Morten","Sørensen, Henrik Toft","Nielsen, Jens Cosedis"],"cuid":["S02-095.56-004629"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Epidemiology","Implantable cardioverter defibrillator","Incidence","Risk factor","Venous thromboembolism"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"venous thromboembolism in patients with implantable cardioverter defibrillators","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85021842966","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-095.56-004629","identifier":[{"id":"85021842966","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000404445200016","type":"wos"},{"id":"27256414","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-5f4dc7c1-e3ff-4855-8d18-d71a1d6cad70","au-2231841f-37a5-47b2-9ee6-4b78baced377"],"keyword":["Epidemiology","Implantable cardioverter-defibrillator","Incidence","Risk factor","Venous thromboembolism"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-278ABFE34C6F369836D3BC96834D8C10"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Cardiological Medicine B"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Hjertemedicin (Kardiologi) [Klinik Hjerte-Lunge]","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Hjerte-Lunge"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Susanne Bendesgaard","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"858eb103-7bd2-4736-b8ea-bb02d96d0169","name":"Pedersen, Susanne Bendesgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Pihlkjær","key":"hjortshøjpau","last":"Hjortshøj","locid":"d24227f4-62ce-4a90-86ec-482cf4e88a34","name":"Hjortshøj, Søren Pihlkjær","orcid":"0000-0002-4231-9963","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans Erik","key":"bøtkerpau","last":"Bøtker","locid":"09b03c00-11a8-4f72-800f-181f26155750","name":"Bøtker, Hans Erik","orcid":"0000-0001-6358-8962","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dóra Körmendiné","key":"farkaspau","last":"Farkas","locid":"573f7202-6799-4977-bf11-f1e017ac21a2","name":"Farkas, Dóra Körmendiné","orcid":"0000-0002-8577-048X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"21e3a3e6-e25e-48cf-b243-b8f43dca3bb8","name":"Schmidt, Morten","orcid":"0000-0002-4935-4059","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Toft","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"4d49d93a-4913-4223-ba59-272e717a845d","name":"Sørensen, Henrik Toft","orcid":"0000-0003-4299-7040","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Cosedis","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"cc1c8be7-f54a-4722-8077-aa358f9b090a","name":"Nielsen, Jens C