{"abstract":"Studies on the value of culture-independent molecular identification of bacteria in cardiac valves are mostly restricted to comparing agreement of identification to what is obtained by culture to the number of identified bacteria in culture-negative cases. However, evaluation of the usefulness of direct molecular identification should also address weaknesses, their relevance in the given setting, and possible improvements. In this study cardiac valves from 56 Danish patients referred for surgery for infective endocarditis were analysed by microscopy and culture as well as by PCR targeting part of the bacterial 16S rRNA gene followed by DNA sequencing of the PCR product. PCR and DNA sequencing identified significant bacteria in 49 samples from 43 patients, including five out of 13 culture-negative cases. No rare, exotic, or intracellular bacteria were identified. There was a general agreement between bacterial identity obtained by ribosomal PCR and DNA sequencing from the valves and bacterial isolates from blood culture. However, DNA sequencing of the 16S rRNA gene did not discriminate well among non-haemolytic streptococci, especially within the Streptococcus mitis group. Ribosomal PCR with subsequent DNA sequencing is an efficient and reliable method of identifying the cause of IE, but exact species identification of some of the most common causes, i.e. non-haemolytic streptococci, may be improved with other molecular methods.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Kemp, Michael","Bangsborg, Jette Marie","Kjerulf, Anne","Schmidt, Thomas Andersen","Christensen, John","Irmukhamedov, Akhmadjon 6","Bruun, Niels Eske","Dargis, Rimtas","Andresen, Keld","Christensen, Jens Jørgen"],"cuid":["S02-098.79-042228"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["16S rRNA gene","BLAST"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"advantages and limitations of ribosomal rna pcr and dna sequencing for identification of bacteria in cardiac valves of danish patients","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2174/1874285801307010146","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-098.79-042228","identifier":[{"id":"24403979","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3883160","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84899799587","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-4c63842e-eb53-4fab-97df-37dde6966192","sdu-1c213382-6dc7-45e3-8530-d5962f3defc7"],"keyword":["16S RRNA gene","BLAST","Culture independent identification","NCBI database","Streptococcus mitis group","Viridans streptococci"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-939037E1CF99540213B96137C34EB7F2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2174/1874285801307010146","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Clinical Microbiology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ssi statens serum institut","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-SSI","l3nn":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","namevar":["Statens Serum Institut"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-SSI","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Immunology and Microbiology, Department of Immunology and Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"region zealand","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-ZEA","l3nl":"Region Zealand","l3nn":"Region Zealand","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region Zealand","namevar":["Holbæk Sygehus"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-ZEA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"kempmichaelpau","last":"Kemp","locid":"d28a28b7-cbe0-42f1-b2c6-ff6a89cafcf8","name":"Kemp, Michael","orcid":"0000-0001-5989-0421","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","first":"Jette","key":"bangsborgjettemariepau","last":"Bangsborg","locid":"d023bdba-0452-41f0-868d-14dbd8802219","name":"Bangsborg, Jette Marie","name_org":"Bangsborg, Jette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jette","key":"bangsborgjettepau","last":"Bangsborg","name":"Bangsborg, Jette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"Anne","key":"kjerulfannepau","last":"Kjerulf","name":"Kjerulf, Anne","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Thomas Andersen","key":"schmidtthomasandersenpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"ee53f5e1-f71c-4bb4-a169-033b28936614","name":"Schmidt, Thomas Andersen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"andersenschmidtthomaspau","last":"Andersen Schmidt","name":"Andersen Schmidt, Thomas","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","first":"John","key":"christensenjohnpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, John","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Akhmadjon 6","key":"irmukhamedovakhmadjon6pau","last":"Irmukhamedov","name":"Irmukhamedov, Akhmadjon 6","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Akhmadjon","key":"irmukhamedovakhmadjonpau","last":"Irmukhamedov","name":"Irmukhamedov, Akhmadjon","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","first":"Niels Eske","key":"bruunnielseskepau","last":"Bruun","locid":"32335505-0bdf-4b5c-8d49-212bddd9243d","name":"Bruun, Niels Eske","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Rimtas","key":"dargisrimtaspau","last":"Dargis","name":"Dargis, Rimtas","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Keld","key":"andresenkeldpau","last":"Andresen","name":"Andresen, Keld","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jens Jørgen","key":"christensenjensjørgenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Jens Jørgen","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24403979"],"pub":{"doi":"10.2174/1874285801307010146","issn":["18742858"],"journal":"The Open Microbiology Journal","pages":"146-151","publisher":"Bentham Open","status":"p","title":"The Open Microbiology Journal","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84899799587"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Region Zealand","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-4c63842e-eb53-4fab-97df-37dde6966192","sdu-1c213382-6dc7-45e3-8530-d5962f3defc7"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Advantages and Limitations of Ribosomal RNA PCR and DNA Sequencing for Identification of Bacteria in Cardiac Valves of Danish Patients","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.79-042228","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Stroke is a major cause of death and severe disability, but effective treatments are limited. Neuroglobin, a neuronal heme-globin, has been advocated as a novel pharmacological target in combating stroke and neurodegenerative disorders based on cytoprotective properties. Using thoroughly validated antibodies and oligos, we give a detailed brain anatomical characterization of transgenic mice over expressing Neuroglobin. Moreover, using permanent middle artery occlusion the effect of elevated levels of Neuroglobin on ischemic damage was studied. Lastly, the impact of mouse strain genetic background on ischemic damage was investigated.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Raida, Zindy","Hundahl, Christian Ansgar","Nyengaard, Jens Randel","Hay-Schmidt, Anders"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-186883"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"neuroglobin over expressing mice expression pattern and effect on brain ischemic infarct size","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3788103/pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-186883","identifier":[{"id":"84885029621","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC3788103","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"24098534","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-64c6ad3a-fcd6-434f-88f2-fb2f26cde501"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-273A4388A35C15559845C95CBF9C785B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0076565","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3788103/pdf",