{"abstract":"Neuroglobin is considered to be a novel important pharmacological target in combating stroke and neurodegenerative disorders, although the mechanism by which this protection is accomplished remains an enigma. We hypothesized that if neuroglobin is directly involved in neuroprotection, then permanent cerebral ischemia would lead to larger infarct volumes in neuroglobin-null mice than in wild-type mice.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Raida, Zindy","Hundahl, Christian Ansgar","Kelsen, Jesper","Nyengaard, Jens Randel","Hay-Schmidt, Anders"],"cuid":["S02-090.97-026323"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reduced infarct size in neuroglobin null mice after experimental stroke in vivo","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3487987/pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-090.97-026323","identifier":[{"id":"22901501","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3487987","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84868544200","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-bbd86092-4d6b-44de-816f-df61bef9d6fb","ku-0d681784-1c37-40e7-8906-d5aefbe164fb"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-E0FE196BD54E38D2FDB2C01D2ECA7417"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3487987/pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/2040-7378-4-15","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2012","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Neuroscience, Laboratory of Neural Plasticity"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Neurosurgery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"unclear universities","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-UND","l3nl":"Undetermined","l3nn":"Unclear Universities","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Unclear Universities","namevar":["Institut for Klinisk Medicin - Elektronmikroskopisk Laboratorium"],"nora_code":"DI-U-UND","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Zindy","key":"raidapau","last":"Raida","locid":"81f7b0a7-2a31-48f9-a8d3-b10ecf0d0d4c","name":"Raida, Zindy","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian Ansgar","key":"hundahlpau","last":"Hundahl","locid":"03ecdba8-e37b-44fb-8702-065cf1a31e62","name":"Hundahl, Christian Ansgar","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper","key":"kelsenpau","last":"Kelsen","locid":"5d9b376f-8fa3-4879-b27e-184ef5f90a43","name":"Kelsen, Jesper","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Randel","key":"nyengaardpau","last":"Nyengaard","locid":"8288d58c-4602-4c0c-9b76-949cc83d281b","name":"Nyengaard, Jens Randel","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Anders","key":"hayschmidtpau","last":"Hay-Schmidt","locid":"f0f495a2-fe48-4cdf-8f27-ea207182bda8","name":"Hay-Schmidt, Anders","orcid":"0000-0001-9984-7014","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22901501"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/2040-7378-4-15","issn":["20407378"],"issue":"1","journal":"Experimental & Translational Stroke Medicine","pages":"1-12","publisher":"BioMed Central","status":"p","title":"Experimental & Translational Stroke Medicine","volume":"4"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84868544200"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Undetermined","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-bbd86092-4d6b-44de-816f-df61bef9d6fb","ku-0d681784-1c37-40e7-8906-d5aefbe164fb"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Reduced infarct size in neuroglobin-null mice after experimental stroke in vivo","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-090.97-026323","year":"2012","yearsub":2013}
{"abstract":"In many intensive care units, loop diuretics are used more or less routinely to achieve a urinary output above 1 ml/kg/h in critically ill patients. We do not in the literature find any basis of this strategy. In contrast, this practice may cause a risk of circulatory instability in the critically ill patient due to large diuresis and volume depletion. There is no evidence so far that the use of loop diuretics has a renal protective effect or any other beneficial impact on the renal function. The use of loop diuretics in oliguric critically ill patients may be harmful. Consequently an individual assessment is required.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Runge-Sørensen, Charlotte","Madsen, Jens Kristian","Schmidt, Frank","Sloth, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-260414"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Acute kidney injury","Critical Illness","Diuresis","Evidence Based Medicine","Fluid Therapy","Furosemide","Humans","Intensive Care Units","Kidney","Renal Insufficiency","Risk Factors","Sodium Potassium Chloride Symporter Inhibitors"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ingen evidens for nyreprotektiv effekt af loopdiuretika til oliguriske patienter","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84868684509","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-260414","identifier":[{"id":"23095649","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84868684509","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-e58dcf52-b120-4588-97b9-41ab10f46a1b"],"keyword":["Acute Kidney Injury","Critical Illness","Diuresis","Evidence-Based Medicine","Fluid Therapy","Furosemide","Humans","Intensive Care Units","Kidney","Oliguria","Renal Insufficiency","Risk Factors","Sodium Potassium Chloride Symporter Inhibitors"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-37A20FC9676DDA04DDD0EBF36F1BED68"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Medicine and Nephrology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"rungesørensenpau","last":"Runge-Sørensen","name":"Runge-Sørensen, Charlotte","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Kristian","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"8a4d9cc8-0f37-4232-a534-68a339d26044","name":"Madsen, Jens Kristian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Frank","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"316029d8-32e4-4289-9b4c-487d3ff3dd61","name":"Schmidt, Frank","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"slothpau","last":"Sloth","locid":"900ac99a-5848-49d4-820b-6641d27af51a","name":"Sloth, Erik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23095649"],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"43","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","pages":"2617-20","publisher":"Almindelige Danske Lægeforening","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"174"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84868684509"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All 