{"abstract":"The ALICE Collaboration has studied J/psi production in pp collisions at sqrt(s)=7 TeV at the LHC through its muon pair decay. The polar and azimuthal angle distributions of the decay muons were measured, and results on the J/psi polarization parameters lambda_theta and lambda_phi were obtained. The study was performed in the kinematic region 2.5y2p_t","author_count":910,"contributors":["ALICE Collaboration, The","Abelev, B.","Abrahantes Quintana, A.","Adamova, D.","M. Adare, A.","M. Aggarwal, M.","Aglieri Rinella, G.","G. Agocs, A.","Agostinelli, A.","Aguilar Salazar, S.","Ahammed, Z.","Ahmad Masoodi, A.","U. Ahn, S.","Akindinov, A.","Aleksandrov, D.","Alessandro, B.","Alfaro Molina, R.","Alici, A.","Alkin, A.","AlmarazAvina, E.","Alt, T.","Altini, V.","Altinpinar, S.","Altsybeev, I.","Andrei, C.","Andronic, A.","Anguelov, V.","Anson, C.","Anticic, T.","Antinori, F.","Antonioli, P.","Aphecetche, L.","Appelshauser, H.","Arbor, N.","Arcelli, S.","Arend, A.","Armesto, N.","Arnaldi, R.","Aronsson, T.","C. Arsene, I.","Arslandok, M.","Asryan, A.","Averbeck, R.","C. Awes, T.","Aysto, J.","D. Azmi, M.","Badala, A.","W. Baek, Y.","Bailhache, R.","Bala, R.","Baldini Ferroli, R.","Baldisseri, A.","Baldit, A.","Ban, J.","C. Baral, R.","Barbera, R.","Barile, F.","G. Barnafoldi, G.","S. Barnby, L.","Barret, V.","Bartke, J.","Basile, M.","Bastid, N.","Bathen, B.","Batigne, G.","Batyunya, B.","Baumann, C.","Bearden, Ian","Belikov, I.","Bellini, F.","Bellwied, R.","Belmont-Moreno, E.","Beole, S.","Berceanu, I.","Bercuci, A.","Berdnikov, Y.","Berenyi, D.","Betev, L.","Bhasin, A.","K. Bhati, A.","Bianchi, N.","Bianchi, L.","Bianchin, C.","Bielcik, J.","Bielcikova, J.","Bilandzic, Ante","Blanco, F.","Blanco, F.","Blau, D.","Blume, C.","Boccioli, M.","Bock, N.","Bogdanov, A.","Bøggild, Hans","Bogolyubsky, M.","Boldizsar, L.","Bombara, M.","Book, J.","Borel, H.","Borissov, A.","Bortolin, C.","Bossu, F.","Botje, M.","Bottger, S.","Boyer, B.","Braun-Munzinger, P.","Bregant, 