,"DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ac80c25f-fde9-407f-bed2-dd9955feb3b3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Peritonealdialysekatetre","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-496480","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Melt-extruded L-polylactide (PLA) nanocomposite films were prepared from commercially available PLA and laurate-modified Mg–Al layered double hydroxide (LDH-C12). Three films were tested for total migration as well as specific migration of LDH, tin, laurate and low molecular weight PLA oligomers (OLLA). This is the first reported investigation on the migration properties of PLA-LDH nanocomposite films. The tests were carried out as part of an overall assessment of the suitability of such films for use as food contact materials (FCM). Total migration was determined according to a European standard method. All three films showed migration of nanosized LDH, which was quantified using acid digestion followed by inductively coupled plasma mass spectrometric (ICP–MS) detection of 26Mg. Migration of LDH from the films was also confirmed by examining migrates using transmission electron microscopy (TEM) and was attributed indirectly to the significant PLA molecular weight reduction observed in extruded PLA-LDH-C12 films. Migration of tin was detected in two of the film samples prepared by dispersion of LDH-C12 using a masterbatch technique and migration of the laurate organomodifier took place from all three film types. The results indicate that the material properties are in compliance with the migration limits for total migration and specific lauric acid migration as set down by the EU legislation for FCM, at least if a reduction factor for fresh meat is taken into consideration. The tin detected arises from the use of organotin catalysts in the manufacture of PLA.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Schmidt, Bjørn","Katiyar, Vimal","Plackett, David","Larsen, Erik Huusfeldt","Gerds, Nathalie Christiane","Bender Koch, Christian","Petersen, J.H."],"cuid":["S02-089.77-033787"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Biopolymerer","Biopolymers"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"migration of nanosized layered double hydroxide platelets from polylactide nanocomposite films","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/19440049.2011.572927","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-089.77-033787","identifier":[{"id":"21614708","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79960334134","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-35d540f1-63f9-4644-87ec-d1e8334baa90","ku-afce4fad-aec7-4ef2-979f-5e194fe11edd"],"keyword":["Biopolymerer","Biopolymers"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-5A4D6675F1CA1559CAC212B7A3C0F091"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/19440049.2011.572927","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute, Division of Food Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Life Sciences, Department of Basic Sciences and Environment, Environmental Chemistry and Physics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"unclear universities","l2":"