or Severe Sepsis/Septic Shock trial): Study protocol, design and rationale for a double-blinded, randomised clinical trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-092.79-040358","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Deep brain stimulation (DBS) in experimental animals has promoted new indications and refined existing treatments. Implantation of downscaled clinical DBS leads directly compatible with commercially available implantable pulse generators can however be challenging. Accordingly, we have developed a lead implantation device (LID) and technique for minimally invasive implantation of experimental multicontact DBS leads in large research animals.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ettrup, Kåre Schmidt Ettrup","Tornøe, Jens","Sørensen, Jens Christian Hedemann","Bjarkam, Carsten Reidies"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-180080"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a surgical device for minimally invasive implantation of experimental deep brain stimulation leads in large research animals","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jneumeth.2011.06.011","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-180080","identifier":[{"id":"21723320","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79960889726","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-58fd8b36-c211-424d-b353-89b0bb048860"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9E97B8F80542E7A3FFFA4B333CA7441B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jneumeth.2011.06.011","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Facul