{"abstract":"Exposure to particulate matter is associated with oxidative stress and risk of cardiovascular diseases. We investigated if vitamin C and desferrioxamine (iron chelator) altered the levels of oxidative stress and expression of cell adhesion molecules upon exposure to diesel exhaust particles (DEP) and carbon black in cultured human umbilical vein endothelial cells (HUVECs). We found that the particles were only slightly cytotoxic in the high concentration ranges. Particle-induced intracellular reactive oxygen species (ROS) production was attenuated by vitamin C administration or iron chelation and particularly when combined (p","author_count":6,"contributors":["Frikke-Schmidt, Henriette Rønne","Roursgaard, Martin","Lykkesfeldt, Jens","Loft, Steffen","Nøjgaard, Jacob Klenø","Møller, Peter"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-012614"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Ascorbic acid","Cells Cultured","DNA damage","Deferoxamine","Endothelial Cells","Humans","Intercellular Adhesion Molecule 1","Iron Chelating Agents","Oxidative stress","Particle Size","Reactive oxygen species","Soot","Vascular Cell Adhesion Molecule 1","Vehicle Emissions"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effect of vitamin c and iron chelation on diesel exhaust particle and carbon black induced oxidative damage and cell adhesion molecule expression in human endothelial cells","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.toxlet.2011.03.011","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-012614","identifier":[{"id":"79955945964","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21421028","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-0097ea0e-7df7-4357-8b12-c0464f9f0441","ku-a7cbbf03-0388-4d6b-8e5f-bd364214aa76"],"keyword":["Ascorbic Acid","Cells, Cultured","DNA Damage","Deferoxamine","Endothelial Cells","Humans","Intercellular Adhesion Molecule-1","Iron Chelating Agents","Oxidative Stress","Particle Size","Reactive Oxygen Species","Soot","Vascular Cell Adhesion Molecule-1","Vehicle Emissions"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-53D3B014DE0243EF4AE28162B4A4684B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.toxlet.2011.03.011","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Life Sciences, Department of Veterinary Disease Biology, Section of Biomedicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Environmental Science, Department of Environmental Science - Atmospheric Measurements"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henriette Rønne","key":"frikkeschmidtpau","last":"Frikke-Schmidt","locid":"4156ba3e-a9e7-4de4-84ca-fa74dd2fdf15","name":"Frikke-Schmidt, Henriette Rønne","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Martin","key":"roursgaardpau","last":"Roursgaard","locid":"814d875d-de4f-485a-a94c-48ea886acfb5","name":"Roursgaard, Martin","orcid":"0000-0002-7206-0032","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens","key":"lykkesfeldtpau","last":"Lykkesfeldt","locid":"6e71ebed-c114-42ab-9ae9-6333f14bf8ad","name":"Lykkesfeldt, Jens","orcid":"